According to the game, the answer is 23 years old when Sarah gets married.
So, the equation will be 5 + 2x = 23.

Subtract 5 from both sides of the equation:
2x = 18

Now divide both sides of the equation by 2:
x = 9

So, Sarah is now 9 years old.

